reuseParticipation.tree
├── given contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
└── given contract is not paused
    ├── given reentrancy attempt
    │   └── it should revert with reentrancy guard
    └── given no reentrancy
        ├── given caller is not participant and not delegatee
        │   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
        └── given caller is authorized (participant or delegatee)
            ├── given position tapReleased is true
            │   └── it should revert with NotValid
            ├── given position tapAmount is zero
            │   └── it should revert with NotValid
            ├── when rescue mode is active
            │   └── it should revert with RescueModeActive
            ├── when emergency sweep has been activated
            │   └── it should revert with EmergencySweepActivated
            ├── when lastProcessedWeek is behind currentEpoch
            │   └── it should advance week before proceeding
            └── when all conditions are valid
                ├── it should not transfer TAP (reuse existing)
                ├── it should update bucket supply
                ├── given participant has existing unexpired position in target bucket
                │   ├── it should clear votes at past expected expiration
                │   ├── it should add new votes at past expected expiration
                │   ├── it should maintain existing tapAmount
                │   ├── it should update expiry to new bucket lock duration
                │   ├── it should update lockedAt to current timestamp
                │   ├── it should update bucketId to new bucket
                │   ├── it should update multiplier from new bucket
                │   ├── it should update lastInactive and lastActive
                │   ├── it should update weekTotals for new period
                │   └── it should emit Participate event
                └── given participant has no existing position in target bucket
                    ├── it should create new participation with existing tapAmount
                    ├── it should set expiry based on new bucket lock duration
                    ├── it should set multiplier from new bucket
                    ├── it should set lastInactive to current week
                    ├── it should set lastActive to expiry week
                    ├── it should increase weekTotals for current week + 1
                    ├── it should decrease weekTotals for expiry week + 1
                    └── it should emit Participate event 